id: pm-rust-cross-operation-journal
title: Recover pending item journals before every native mutation
description: "Blocking review finding on PR #104: an interrupted native operation leaves a journal that a different mutation skips, permanently conflicting with later retries."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: durability,regression,rust
created_at: "2026-10-23T07:14:34.866Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.089Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.066Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T21:48:10.066Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Directly constructed pending journals cover update-comment-update, comment-update-comment, and isolation of another item; each cross-operation regression has a behavioral revert proof. All native item mutations recover all matching journals under the item lock in deterministic order. Divergent bytes yield a typed refusal naming the journal and remedy. Preserve create and single-operation recovery behavior and refusal codes. just release-check passes unchanged 100 percent floors and mutation oracle parity passes. Open a review-ready PR; leave this item in progress."
parent: pm-rust-u4al
resolution: Every native mutation recovers matching pending journals deterministically under the item lock; cross-operation/isolation/divergence regressions and full native platform/oracle gates pass.
expected_result: "Directly constructed pending journals cover update-comment-update, comment-update-comment, and isolation of another item; each cross-operation regression has a behavioral revert proof. All native item mutations recover all matching journals under the item lock in deterministic order. Divergent bytes yield a typed refusal naming the journal and remedy. Preserve create and single-operation recovery behavior and refusal codes. just release-check passes unchanged 100 percent floors and mutation oracle parity passes. Open a review-ready PR; leave this item in progress."
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/109, merged 2026-10-23T10:08:59Z, merge 5862034d9618aba23ee909d7a9f9bbdd1b78e252: Every native mutation recovers matching pending journals deterministically under the item lock; cross-operation/isolation/divergence regressions and full native platform/oracle gates pass."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T07:14:40.694Z",codex-agent,"Plan: construct first-rename crash states directly using the native journal format in non-git temporary trackers; prove cross-operation failures before changing recovery; drain matching operation journals under the existing item lock and preserve create recovery semantics; run unchanged crate release gates and mutation parity before opening a PR. No process tracing or edits to PR #104/#105 branches."
  "2026-10-23T07:20:04.539Z",codex-agent,"Added three deterministic regressions that reconstruct exact native before images and pending journals from native-produced after bytes/history, without stopping a process. Fixtures use ordinary non-git temporary trackers. The isolation regression includes another identifier ending in the target identifier, guarding against overly broad suffix matching. Initial Rust dependency compilation is running before the expected-failure run."
  "2026-10-23T07:24:59.653Z",codex-agent,"Baseline proof: cargo +1.90.0 test --locked --lib cross_operation_journal -- --nocapture ran the three requested regressions with src/mutation.rs unchanged from origin/main: 0 passed, 3 failed. update-comment-update, comment-update-comment, and the other-item-isolation scenario all fail on the final retry with RecoveryConflict because the item matches neither journal image. No process tracing or timed interruption used."
  "2026-10-23T07:26:57.122Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof complete: with tests unchanged, reverting only the production recovery helper/call-site changes made src/mutation.rs byte-identical to origin/main. cargo +1.90.0 test --locked --lib cross_operation_journal -- --nocapture: 0 passed, 9 failed, exit 101. The three required sequences all failed with RecoveryConflict on the final original-operation retry. Fixed production functions restored; prior fixed run: 9 passed, 0 failed. Additional proofs cover deterministic multi-journal order and unknown operations, pending create history, create admission, typed actionable conflict, discovery I/O refusal, and item-lock exclusion."
  "2026-10-23T07:33:12.898Z",codex-agent,"Fixed linked-test runner passed: pm test --run --match cross_operation_journal --progress, 9 tests passed and zero failures. Project policy disables automatic result storage, so this comment records the receipt. Separately ran the compiled regression harness from a plain temporary directory with an empty PATH, a Git discovery ceiling, and test trackers below the scratch directory: 9 passed, 0 failed. The isolated-HOME just release-check aggregate is running with global and system Git configuration disabled; coverage floors remain unchanged."
  "2026-10-23T07:39:30.474Z",codex-agent,"Additional no-git CLI acceptance passed for update-comment-update and comment-update-comment. Each fresh tracker was created by the locked published pm init sample- --defaults --agent-guidance skip with an empty PATH and Git discovery ceiling. The native binary then created an item, reconstructed the exact pending journal and before images directly, ran the other operation, and retried the original operation. Both scenarios passed; journals were removed and all four history hashes formed a continuous chain."
  "2026-10-23T08:24:38.962Z",codex-agent,"The isolated-HOME local just release-check passed formatting, deny-warnings Clippy, private documentation, 317 library tests, 34 binary tests, 27 ownership oracle comparisons, 6 close oracle comparisons, 2 conformance comparisons, 29 mutation contracts and the intervening suites. Its unchanged relationship_large_edge_limit_finishes_at_budget_floor case reported a failure while orientation peers were still running. The same five-second native-child deadline failure is already documented on main in docs/NATIVE_HOT_PATHS.md and pm-rust-wdj4. Created pm-rust-local-packet-deadline as a focused follow-up. No orientation source, deadline, coverage floor or gate changed. The local aggregate is not counted as passing; exact-commit CI will supply the complete unchanged release gate."
  "2026-10-23T08:26:18.779Z",codex-agent,"The direct filtered orientation-harness retry also failed 0/1 at the unchanged five-second child deadline: native exit code None versus expected 2. This matches the already documented main-branch condition and is tracked by pm-rust-local-packet-deadline. cargo audit separately passed for 136 dependencies with the one existing allowed RUSTSEC-2024-0449 warning. Preparing the implementation commit and PR so the unchanged complete release-check can run on exact-commit CI; local aggregate failure remains explicit."
  "2026-10-23T08:28:29.954Z",codex-agent,"PR opened for review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/pull/109, implementation commit bb7cd2a. Local isolated-HOME just release-check is now terminal: 494 passed, 1 failed, zero ignored; orientation was 31 passed and 1 failed. The sole failure is the unchanged five-second packet child deadline, independently reproduced 0/1 and tracked in pm-rust-local-packet-deadline. Coverage was not reached locally and is not claimed. Exact-commit CI run 39924710637 is queued for all three complete unchanged release aggregates and mutation oracle suites. No bot mentions, thread replies, merges, timeout changes or threshold changes."
  "2026-10-23T08:55:30.452Z",codex-agent,"Exact implementation commit bb7cd2a CI progress: ordinary suites pass on Linux 598/598, macOS 587/587 and Windows 581/581, each with zero failures and zero ignored tests. The macOS complete unchanged release aggregate also passes 587 ordinary plus 587 instrumented tests and 100 percent lines (14054/14054), functions (1464/1464), regions (23452/23452) and branches (3280/3280), followed by audit, changelog and strict tracker health. The previously failing local deadline case passes CI. Linux and Windows aggregates remain in progress. CI run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/actions/runs/39924710637."
  "2026-10-23T09:03:13.687Z",codex-agent,"Implementation bb7cd2a passed all 9 jobs in CI run 39924710637: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rust/actions/runs/39924710637. Complete unchanged just release-check passes on Linux (598 ordinary + 598 instrumented), macOS (587 + 587), and Windows (581 + 581), each with zero failures or ignored tests and exactly 100 percent lines, functions, regions and branches. Deny-warnings Clippy, private documentation, cargo-audit, changelog and strict tracker health pass. Linux oracle suites: ownership 27, close 6, conformance 2, search/collections 17, plus current-oracle certification 13. All nine new regressions pass on every platform under both builds. Raw coverage counts are retained in docs/CROSS_OPERATION_JOURNAL_RECOVERY.md. The separate local aggregate remains 494 passed and one known packet child deadline failure, independently reproduced and tracked by pm-rust-local-packet-deadline. Releasing the claim for orchestrator verification; item stays in progress. Subsequent handoff edits contain only evidence and tracker receipts, with all other inputs verified identical to the tested implementation."
